/analysis/kbs_evict_value_heldout_synthesis_20260811/
/analysis/kbs_controlled_timing_20260810/
/analysis/kbs_controlled_timing_final_analysis_20260811/

# Active/running production campaign output -- do not commit mid-run
# evidence. See docs/DEVELOPMENT_STATUS.md and the active-compute warning
# in docs/NEW_AGENT_HANDOFF.md.
/analysis/continuation_policy_causal_ablation_production_v1/

# Large (100+ MB) staged dataset-release preview containing real derived
